            {'p': 'Most problems in a business relationship can be seen before the contract is signed. Unpaid deliveries, missed deadlines, lawsuits and reputational loss rarely appear from nowhere — the signs are usually already in open sources. A check collects those signs, compares them and judges how serious they are for your particular deal.'},
